# Crypto Exchange Domain Rules for Loon (cleaned)
# Checked 2026-10-30 against public sources (official help pages/docs, v2fly, blackmatrix7, scan sites).
# Evidence labels used below:
#   [official] found on the exchange's own site/docs/announcements
#   [community] listed consistently by v2fly / blackmatrix7 (not official proof)
#   [indirect] seen loaded/linked by the exchange's own site, or third-party scan data
# Anything with no evidence found is kept in a commented "UNVERIFIED" block per exchange.
# Enable those lines yourself only if you have confirmed them.
#
# Requires Loon build 1008+ for DOMAIN-WILDCARD.
# Replace "proxy" with your actual policy group name.
# Place these ABOVE generic GEOIP/DIRECT rules so they are not shadowed.
#
# NOTE on wildcards: "brand.*" matches any host that STARTS with "brand." and
# "*.brand.*" any host containing ".brand.", so lookalikes such as brand.attacker.com
# also match. It only routes traffic via the proxy, but it is not a strict ownership check.
# Wildcards are kept for brands whose country TLDs you want covered.


# ============================================================
# Binance
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,binance.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.binance.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,binancezh.*        # [community] Chinese mirror domains
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.binancezh.*
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bnbstatic.com        # [community] static assets / CDN
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bntrace.com          # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bsappapi.com         # [community] app API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,saasexch.com         # [community] exchange SaaS backend
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,saasexch.cc          # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binanceapi.com       # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancecnt.com       # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancefuture.com    # [community] blackmatrix7
# Related but NOT owned by Binance (enable only if you use them):
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bnbchain.org        # BNB Chain: community-driven, listed by v2fly under binance
# Removed: bsc.news (independent media), trustwallet.com (no longer Binance-owned since 2025-05-15)
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancepay.com      # docs use pay.binance.com / merchant.binance.com

# ============================================================
# Bitget
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,bitget.*           # bitget.com / .site / .cloud ...
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.bitget.*
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitgetapp.com        # [indirect] loaded by Bitget's own site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bgstatic.com         # [indirect] static assets
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bgbstatic.com        # [indirect] static assets
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitgetapps.com      # a scan site flagged brand mismatch
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bguser.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,btsgtm.com

# ============================================================
# Bybit
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,bybit.*            # bybit.com / .io / .biz / .cloud / .tr
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.bybit.*
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytick.com           # [official] api.bytick.com in Bybit API docs
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybitglobal.com      # [community] + loaded by Bybit site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybit-global.com     # [community] + loaded by Bybit site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bycsi.com            # [community] + loaded by Bybit site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byapis.com           # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bycbe.com            # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bymj.io              # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byabcde.com          # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byapps.net           # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byd3c3.com           # [community]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybdc6.com           # [community]
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybitwallet.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybitcdn.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bybitstorage.com

# ============================================================
# OKX
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,okx.*              # okx.com / .co / .me / .ac ...
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.okx.*
# Removed: okx.cab (no evidence of OKX ownership; a phishing database lists web3.okx.cab)
# Note: okx.* still matches okx.cab. Replace the wildcards with explicit
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx.com if you want to exclude it.
# Related, not confirmed as OKX-owned:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okcoin.com          # OKCoin is a separate exchange
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okex.com            # legacy brand
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xlayer.tech         # X Layer RPC; probably OKX, registrant not verified
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oklink.com          # OKLink explorer; OKX affiliate
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-dns.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-dns1.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-dns2.com

