# ============================================================
# Kraken
# ============================================================
# No wildcard: kraken.* would also match kraken.tech (Octopus Energy) and kraken.io (image SaaS).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kraken.com           # [official]
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,payward.com          # [official] parent company
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,krak.app             # [indirect] Krak app, confirmed as Kraken's app by Kraken support
# Removed: krakenflex.com (Octopus Energy), cryptowat.ch (shut down 2023)
# UNVERIFIED:
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,krakenfx.com
#DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kraken.onl

